Oh, it's a service...

311
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:11,457
Automotive service.

312
00:13:11,999 --> 00:13:13,918
Maybe he sells them, maybe he doesn't.

313
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:18,130
-All right, we're going in here.
-[Bridget] Oh!

314
00:13:18,214 --> 00:13:20,007
-[Bridget] Hello.
-How are you today?

315
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:21,091
-Good.
-Good. How are you?

316
